339:           // can be reset by using the 'OWFirst' function.
340:           // This function contains one parameter 'alarm_only'.
341:           // When 'alarm_only' is TRUE (1) the find alarm command
342:           // 0xEC is sent instead of the normal search command 0xF0.
343:           // Using the find alarm command 0xEC will limit the search to only
344:           // 1-Wire devices that are in an 'alarm' state.
345:           //
346:           // Returns:   TRUE (1) : when a 1-Wire device was found and its
347:           //                       Serial Number placed in the global ROM
348:           //            FALSE (0): when no new device was found.  Either the
