66:            /* 
67:            Changes between V1.2.4 and V1.2.5
68:            
69:            	+ Introduced portGLOBAL_INTERRUPT_FLAG definition to test the global 
70:            	  interrupt flag setting.  Using the two bits defined within
71:            	  portINITAL_INTERRUPT_STATE was causing the w register to get clobbered
72:            	  before the test was performed.
73:            
74:            Changes from V1.2.5
75:            
76:            	+ Set the interrupt vector address to 0x08.  Previously it was at the
77:            	  incorrect address for compatibility mode of 0x18.
78:            
79:            Changes from V2.1.1
80:            
81:            	+ PCLATU and PCLATH are now saved as part of the context.  This allows
82:            	  function pointers to be used within tasks.  Thanks to Javier Espeche
83:            	  for the enhancement. 
84:            
85:            Changes from V2.3.1
86:            
87:            	+ TABLAT is now saved as part of the task context.
88:            	
89:            Changes from V3.2.0
90:            
91:            	+ TBLPTRU is now initialised to zero as the MPLAB compiler expects this
92:            	  value and does not write to the register.
93:            */
94:            
